   {
    "en": "Apricot Heart"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "He thought that all he wanted was to see more faces of his.\nThat was the start of it all...\n\nChitose is a novelist in college who had continuously submitted screenplays he wrote to scriptwriting contests in pursuit of a certain dream. After yielding no results, he finishes writing his script, \"Apricot Heart\", deciding it will be his last. However, before he can submit it, he is shocked to learn that the actor Serizawa Kyouhei is going on hiatus.\nHis dream was to have Serizawa Kyouhei act in one of his scripts...\nAfter giving up on submitting his work, Chitose ends up falling asleep, but suddenly, Kyouhei appears right before his eyes!?\n\nFilled with dreams and romance,\nA sweet and sour youth love story."
  },
